--- !u!114 &456523114
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 456523110}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c41099c0a7bc9c646bc8a92111283f27, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _pages:
  - text: Pick up an antenna from the pile on the right by pressing E near it.
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 600e4e0fba338284fa7ee46d8bf31ee6, type: 3}
  - text: It will be placed into one of your inventory slots. Use 1, 2, and 3 to
      switch between slots.
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e82aa7cc5029bca4a9f26287e264c89b, type: 3}
  - text: Select the antenna in your active slot, then place it on a flat surface
      by holding LMB.
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 36672e47363289b41ac8188dbdbb0d44, type: 3}
  - text: Deploy the antenna by pressing E while standing next to it.
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e130268f3c9c28442b9a9709c02d85ba, type: 3}
  - text: "Activate the antenna by pressing the button on its panel. Switch antennas
      off during a storm \u2014 it reduces the chance of them breaking down."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 020e8741669242641ab2077d166cb532, type: 3}
  - text: "Place a second antenna the same way \u2014 at a distance from the first
      one. Deploy it too."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c502d47f49517634cbdb949c9f68a0bd, type: 3}
  - text: Adjust the second antenna dish so that its face points toward the first
      antenna. Look at the dish and use Q and E to rotate it.
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 25a58de5838887647b0188d09436916b, type: 3}
  - text: Walk up to the first antenna and enter its monitor. Use WASD to aim the
      crosshair at the second antenna's dish.
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b23cdea350852204f916a7c6151b31c0, type: 3}
  - text: "Once aimed \u2014 press LMB. If done correctly, the signal will be successfully
      transmitted."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2d7b2be6bc0d804449d8df3fd8cb9c79, type: 3}
  - text: From the antenna that received the signal, you can relay it further the
      exact same way.
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 82a0edaaa7324ce43a741934a1443c35, type: 3}
  - text: "Tips:\r\nA storm can damage your antennas. Repair them using a wrench.\r\n\r"
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ba895326e23ad3741b32b07d5334b635, type: 3}
  - text: "Tips:\r\r\nStay on schedule! This mission can't afford delays.\r"
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ed4acaff00dcfa0468d17f42473d59e4, type: 3}
  _pageText: {fileID: 947013906}
  _pageImage: {fileID: 678516088}
  _imageContainer: {fileID: 87774622}
  _pageCounter: {fileID: 34836601}
  _btnNextObject: {fileID: 1974358151}
  _btnPrevObject: {fileID: 349854070}
  _interactRange: 3
  _interactLayer:
    serializedVersion: 2
    m_Bits: 4096
  _hintNext: {fileID: 871617174}
  _hintPrev: {fileID: 1037042343}
